WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:02.907
In partnership with the Scared Straight program

00:00:02.907 --> 00:00:06.815
the Georgia Bulldogs, after almost blowing it to Missouri

00:00:07.326 --> 00:00:09.924
are spending the day in the FBS Basement

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:13.463
where the worst teams in college football reside.

00:00:13.932 --> 00:00:16.552
and hopefully he'll be scared straight.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.733
Woooo!

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:22.341
You're in my world now!

00:00:22.341 --> 00:00:23.155
Yeah!

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:24.829
and the only thing you're number one in is...

00:00:25.204 --> 00:00:28.594
underutilizing five star talent in multiple positions.

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:31.739
Toledo smoking me by 45 doesn't even phase me anymore.

00:00:31.739 --> 00:00:33.110
Yum. Yum. Yum. Yum.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.221
And if you don't start stalling out offensive drives in the red zone

00:00:36.221 --> 00:00:37.496
That's gonna be you too!

00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:39.374
I know you like to fumble so DROP THE BALL!

00:00:39.374 --> 00:00:40.506
Drop the ball!

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:41.777
DROP THE BALL!

00:00:41.777 --> 00:00:44.514
I beat Fresno State and they're acting like I won the Super Bowl.

00:00:44.514 --> 00:00:46.972
and if you don't get Brock Bowers the ball in space

00:00:46.972 --> 00:00:48.401
That's gonna be you!

00:00:48.401 --> 00:00:49.542
MMmmm!

00:00:49.542 --> 00:00:51.651
Oh it's gonna happen! Look at his face!

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:54.377
He's ready to give up a 63 yard run right up the middle!

00:00:54.377 --> 00:00:57.015
You wanna meet our strength and conditioning coach?

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:59.041
Well too bad cuz it's not a person!

00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:02.576
It's a YouTube video on how to stay fit in your twilight years!

00:01:02.576 --> 00:01:07.851
Fellas I'm sorry but you're all in the group of five I mean what do you expect?

00:01:07.851 --> 00:01:10.334
*crazy look of knowing they were all hanging out with Vandy up until four weeks ago*

00:01:10.761 --> 00:01:13.844
Oh. You think because you're a power five

00:01:14.251 --> 00:01:15.933
This can't happen to you?

00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:16.737
This guy just ain't gettin it!

00:01:16.737 --> 00:01:17.921
We need the Buff!

00:01:17.921 --> 00:01:19.677
Yeah! We need the Buff.

00:01:19.677 --> 00:01:21.438
The Buff? What's the buff?

00:01:21.438 --> 00:01:27.599
*door rumbling sound of even after firing their coach and OC and not even being in the conference we normally cover they still gonna get the smoke for being bad*

00:01:29.475 --> 00:01:30.378
Where is he!?

00:01:31.598 --> 00:01:33.835
You don't think this could happen to a power five?

00:01:33.835 --> 00:01:35.300
 Look at me!

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.524
Colorado! What are you doing here?

00:01:36.524 --> 00:01:40.378
I used to be just like you. National Champion. Top of the world.

00:01:41.066 --> 00:01:42.205
Wanna know what I'm doing now?

00:01:42.205 --> 00:01:45.450
Let's just say that Vegas has me as a 7.5  point dog.

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.329
To my bye week!

00:01:47.506 --> 00:01:48.101
No!

00:01:48.487 --> 00:01:48.987
Yeah!

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.720
It's too late for me.

00:01:52.189 --> 00:01:54.514
But if you start letting Stetson Bennet extend plays with his legs and

00:01:54.514 --> 00:02:01.071
stop letting pee wee football defensive line stunts from the opposing team ruin your run game...then maybe,

00:02:01.884 --> 00:02:02.889
 just maybe, 

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.335
you won't end up in here like me.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.111
Hope it worked.

00:02:13.111 --> 00:02:15.024
But you almost lose to that Missouri team and

00:02:15.024 --> 00:02:17.068
It might already be too late.

00:02:18.131 --> 00:02:19.506
Got to put that dog down.

